; targets: enc
; The encoding of tlbias and tlbigp (54-mn-tlbx.hbnf): a form of its own, one register (the shape reg5 of 21-enc-shapes.hbnf), and one leaf.  It is not a leaf of the generated form SYSR: the
; generator owns the leaves of its forms and would lay them all out again.  The prefix 0b1111110010 is 64 first-parcel patterns that no leaf used (a 10-bit prefix, one bit of sub-opcode and
; the register: 16 bits); tools/mkenc.py fails, naming the overlap, if it is not free.  Two bytes each.
forms =/ "TLBX"
form-TLBX = o1:reg5
leaf-TLBX-1 = 0b1101001100 sub:1 o1-r:5
sub-TLBX-1 = "tlbias" | "tlbigp"
